# aliases.ndjson is curated and committed. defs.ndjson and meta.json are GENERATED by
# `ppcli.ps1 index` against your own running game and are not published: a catalog built on one
# install carries that install's mods and pins that install's game build. meta.json records the
# game version and build stamp, so a stale one is visible rather than silent - re-run `index`
# after a game update.
*.tmp
